   "widgets_values": [
    "Same stereo conversion, but Load Video picks the clip from ComfyUI's input\nfolder instead of typing a path. Use the node's upload button to add a new\nclip, or drop an mp4 into ComfyUI\\input\\.\n\nConsecutive frames become the two eyes: frame 1 left, frame 2 right, etc.\n8 fps = pacing of the source.  16 fps = source frame rate, motion 2x faster.\n\nVIEWING: default 'cross-eyed' (left = frame 1) is the verified order. Pick\n'parallel / headset' to swap the halves for a headset."
